                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        Number of
                        plots may increase or decrease depending on the availability of the land.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>4.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;line-height:
  106%;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Following
                        shall be the criteria to determine application under reservation/expansion
                        category
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <span style='color:black'>4.1.</span><span style='font-size:7.0pt;
  line-height:106%;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>For existing Noida allottees</span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.8in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(i)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Only those
                        applicants who have a definite PAN Number are eligible to apply. Application
                        forms indicating no PAN Number or “PAN Number applied for” would be summarily
                        rejected.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.8in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(ii)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Existing noida
                        allottee(s), who have fully utilized their existing industrial
                        property/properties for the permitted industrial purpose, may apply.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.8in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(iii)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Existing noida
                        allottee(s)/transferee(s) of unused/partly utilized existing industrial
                        property are not eligible to apply. Allottee(s) who have been issued notice
                        against unauthorized use of their industrial premise s are also not eligible
                        to apply
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.8in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(iv)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Noida
                        allottee(s)/ transferee(s) who have transferred/ partly changed the
                        constitution of industrial property outside specified family members are not
                        eligible to apply. However in cases of 100% CIC in one go, being at par with
                        transfer cases are eligible to apply.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.8in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(v)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The functional
                        units of NOIDA who have been allotted plots in earlier reserve/expansion
                        category scheme(s) by draw of plots are not eligible to get a plot under
                        reservation/expansion.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(vi)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Noida
                        entrepreneurs who have transferred their original plot and further purchased
                        an industrial plot of bigger size from open market are eligible to apply,
                        provided the new unit has been declared functional by the authority before
                        opening date of the scheme.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(vii)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Only one
                        application shall be entertained from a unit declared functional. The
                        applicant may be sole proprietor/partner in case of partnership firm/director
                        in case of a company or respective spouse/children . In case where more than
                        one application is received against one unit in same constitution, only one
                        application shall be entertained.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(viii)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Subject to
                        above and the cases where no renting exists, 33% of the plots available in
                        this scheme are reserved for functional units, its proprietor (s)/
                        partners(s)/director(s)/share holder(s) and their spouse/ children.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(ix)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Existing noida
                        allottee(s) whose existing unit has been in production for the last 5 years
                        and has been declared functional by NOIDA are eligible to apply. Allottee has
                        to submit a No Dues Certificate from AO(IAA) at the time of submission of
                        application form.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(x)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Under expansion
                        category application from any one partner/spouse/children, no objection
                        certificate from other partners shall be required. In case of application(s)
                        from any of the director/spouse/children, resolution passed by the company
                        shall be required.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:57.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(xi)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Transfer/change
                        in constitution outside specified family members, as per Industrial Policy
                        and Procedure 2012, will not be permitted for 05 years w.e.f. the date of
                        allotment of plot allotted under expansion category of this scheme.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:55.2pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>(xii)</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Existing noida
                        allottee(s) who have fully utilized the existing industrial
                        property/properties for permitted industrial purpose may apply but shall be
                        considered under expansion/reserve category subject to condition that they
                        have not closed/shut down their industrial unit and have not rented their
                        industrial plot premises. Applicants shall submit an affidavit ion this
                        regard. Such allottees, who have defaulted against their dues to the
                        Authority shall not be eligible under expansion category.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:55.2pt;text-align:justify'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        Violation any
                        of the above
                        (i)/(ii)/(iii)/(iv)/(v)/(vi)/(vii)/(vii)/(viii)/(ix)/(x)/(xi)/(xii) by the
                        applicant/allottee may lead to cancellation of allotment of plot, if any and
                        in these case the deposited amount will be forfeited irrespective of the
                        status/stage of the case. Conditions from (i) to (xii) shall apply to
                        applicants who already own an industrial plot in NOIDA.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>&nbsp;</p>
