                        plots available, the applicants shall be invited for a screening in person
                        before the Screening Committee. The Screening Committee shal lthen recommend
                        theselected applicants for land/plot allotment after examining their
                        applications.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
