                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>5.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;line-height:
  106%;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                WHO
                                CAN APPLY UNDER GENERAL CATEGORY
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        A sole
                        proprietor, A registered partnership firm, A duly incorporated Pvt. Ltd.
                        Co./Ltd Co. a proposed partnership firm/company can also apply provided names
                        of the all proposed partners/shareholders/ directors are clearly mentioned in
                        the application from.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>6.</span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        While
                        submitting project report along with the application, the applicants should
                        refer to Annexure III in this application form which mentions the list of
                        permitted projects in NOIDA. However, applicants may apply for a different
                        project other than this list provided the project has been cleared in Green
                        Category issued by Uttar Pradesh Pollution Control Board. Chief Executive
                        Officer, NOIDA shall be the final authority to grant permission for such
                        project after due consideration.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:6.0pt'>
                    <b><span style='color:black'>7.</span></b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'><u>HOW TO&nbsp; APPLY</u></span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoBodyText3 style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:
  -.5in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (i)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The Application Form for
                        allotment of plot of above category shall be available on Noida Authority
                        Website: <a href="http://www.noidaauthorityonline.com">
                            <span style='color:black'>www.noidaauthorityonline.com</span>
                        </a>, online only
                        against payment of Rs. 5000/- <br>
                        (
                    </span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>+ 18% GST Rs. 900/-</span><span style='color:black'>
                        ) which can be paid online through ICICI Bank Ltd., HDFC
                        Bank Ltd. and Indusind Bank Ltd.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoBodyText3 style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:
  -.5in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (ii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                        Application must
                        be complete in all respects. Application form submitted with incomplete information(s)/
                        enclosure(s) shall be summarily rejected.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (iii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        An applicant can apply for more
                        than one plot under different category . However, the applicant shall have to
                        apply for each plot area category separately and submit respective form fee,
                        processing fee and reservation money along with every application.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (iv)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><b><span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'> </span></b><span style='color:black'>
                        The rates of allotment stated in p oint 8of this form are
                        subject to change without notice. THE RATES PREVAILING ON THE DATE OF ISSUE
                        OF ALLOTMENT LETTER WOULD BE APPLICABLE, <span style='text-transform:uppercase'>
                            irrespective
                            of the date of application or interview.
                        </span>
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (v)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        An applicant may be allotted a
                        plot measuring more or less than the area applied for, depending on the
                        assessment of the project by the A llotmentCommittee of the NOIDA.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (vi)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><b><span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'> </span></b><span style='color:black'>
                        In case where applicants is allotted more than one plot,
                        location charges would be imposed on the entire area of all the plots
                        allotted.&nbsp;
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (vii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The application forms duly
                        completed in all respects along with project report, reservation money,
                        processing fee and other necessary documents as per table in page 4 &amp; 5
                        of this form are to be submitted online before 5.00 p.m. on 22.09.2017
                    </span>.
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (viii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        This scheme is a closeended
                        scheme. However, the NOIDA reserves the right toclose the scheme bef ore
                        scheduled end date without any notice or without assigning any reasons.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (ix)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The decision of the Noida on any
                        application at any stage shall be final and binding on the applicant. No
                        correspondence shall be entertained in this regard.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>&nbsp;</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
