                        exclusive of GST. The accrued GST charges shall have to borne by the
                        allottee.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:
  normal'>
                    <b><span style='color:black'>25.</span></b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:
  7.0pt;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                PERIOD
                                OF LEASE
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
