                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:
  justify;text-indent:-27.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    v.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        That the lessor/the NOIDA reserves the right
